### Get all contacts
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts

### Get a single contact by id
### Replace the id below with a real _id copied from the response above
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID

### Create a new contact
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alan",
  "lastName": "Turing",
  "email": "alan.turing@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Green",
  "birthday": "1912-06-23"
}

### Create a new contact with a missing field (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Incomplete",
  "lastName": "Contact"
}

### Update a contact
### Replace the id below with a real _id
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contacts/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alan",
  "lastName": "Turing",
  "email": "alan.turing@updated.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Blue",
  "birthday": "1912-06-23"
}

### Delete a contact
### Replace the id below with a real _id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contacts/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID
